cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "VOLE-Document: byte-exact procedural document storage"
abstract: >-
  VOLE-Document persists a bounded deterministic reconstruction description of a
  document — reconstruction structure, parameters/state, typed residual channels,
  and (later) typed rANS channels — and materializes the exact original document
  bytes on demand. The exact profile's invariant is
  materialize(descriptor) == original_bytes.
version: 0.1.0-alpha.7
license: "MIT OR Apache-2.0"
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/infinityabundance/vole-document"
keywords:
  - compression
  - rans
  - document
  - pdf
  - archival
  - byte-exact
authors:
